  <section>
    <h2>Result</h2>
    <p class="c-lead">Three awards for the team, a talk at the ADC, and the photographs of the exhibition.</p>
    <p>
      The exhibition ran from 30 July to 3 October 2021. I photographed it before it opened, and the photographs are
      credited to me wherever they appear, from HTWG Konstanz to the University of Konstanz. The project won three
      awards, all for the team, and in October 2022 I was on stage with the team to present it at the ADC in Stuttgart.
    </p>
    <dl class="c-numbers">
      <div><dt>Red Dot</dt><dd>Junior Award 2022, Exhibition Design</dd></div>
      <div><dt>ADC Gold</dt><dd>Talent Award 2022, Exhibition</dd></div>
      <div><dt>CommAwards</dt><dd>2021, Gold in the category Space</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

